 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kenseijo Adel no Yarinaoshi ~Kako ni Modotta Saikyou Kensei, Hime wo Sukuu Tame ni Seijo to Naru~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "剣聖女アデルのやり直し ～過去に戻った最強剣聖、姫を救うために聖女となる～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Sword Saint Adel's Second Chance"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Hailed as the hero for leading his country to victory from a great war, the blind Sword Saint Adel is now in despair. Unfortunately, he failed to protect his benefactor, Princess Euphinea, whom he dedicated his entire life to. \n\n\"I want to meet the princess once again,\" he muttered, wishing deeply that his prayers would be answered. A mysterious being, having heard his plea, granted his prayers, and he was sent back to the past, to a time when the princess is still alive. \n\nUnexpectedly, the Sword Saint (♂) has been transformed into a super-duper cute Sword Saintess (♀), and her heroic tale of unrivaled power will once again take place.",
   "ja": "大戦で国を勝利に導き、英雄と称えられながらも、剣聖アデルは絶望の中にいた。なぜなら生涯の忠誠を誓ったユーフィニア姫を戦火から守り切ることができず、失ってしまったから……。\n\n「願わくば、もう一度姫様にお会いしたい」\n\nその切なる願いは高次の存在によって叶えられ、姫がまだ生きている過去へと送られるアデル。ところが、その姿はなぜか美少女になっていて――!?"
  },
